{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12796","headline":"送万巨 · 韩翃","name":"送万巨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉相见王陵，扬州事张禹。\n风帆木兰檝，水国莲花府。\n百丈清江十月天，寒城鼓角晓钟前。\n金炉促膝诸曹吏，玉管繁华美少年。\n有时过向长干地，远对湖光近山翠。\n好逢南苑看人归，也向西池留客醉。\n高柳垂烟橘带霜，朝游石渚暮横塘。\n红牋色夺风流座，白苎词倾翰墨场。\n夫子前年入朝後，高名籍籍时贤口。\n共怜诗兴转清新，继远家声在此身。\n屈指待爲青琐客，回头莫羡白亭人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩翃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12796.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12796","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}